# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

Manages one application in the macOS Dock persistent apps section.

Terraform must run as provider `target_user`, and that user must own the active macOS desktop session. If this resource blocks an apply for another or inactive user, log in as that user and run Terraform from a terminal in the desktop session without `sudo`. Use `terraform apply -target=<unaffected-resource-address>` only when specific unaffected resources must be staged first.

